          "text": "Gastrointestinal symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sudden onset at approximately 3 am today: nausea, 4 episodes of non-bloody, non-bilious vomiting, and 3 episodes of watery brown diarrhoea. Last vomit approximately 5 hours before assessment. No blood or mucus reported."
      }
    },
